body:
London water will be the death of me ☠️ not sure how it’s taken me until my early 30s to realise that it could well be the hard water I wash my face and hair in daily that’s causing my recurrent acne… it’s no coincidence that it “magically” disappears when showering abroad! 🚿🧿

@water2skin to my rescue 🛟 a shower filter (rainfall or handheld or both) that reduces chlorine, limescale and other nasty contaminants found in our water - and wait for it - that doesn’t stand out like a sore thumb in your bathroom, it actually looks good! 

bravo @gracebeverley (yet again) and I promise you this took me less than 30 seconds to install without needing to check any manual…
